      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Date: \t14. mar 2012 10.29.12 CET",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "To: \tSupport and info exchange list for Fedora users. <fedora-commons-users@lists.sourceforge.net>",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Is there a function to return a datastream as an XML tree ?",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
